    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36904" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξαργῠρ-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>turn into money,</i>
			
				v.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξαργυρόω</span>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				8.81
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τὴν οὐσίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					5.8
				</span></i>
			, cf. Mitteis <i><span class="en">
				<u>Chr.</u>
				88iv23
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>:—
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξαργυρίσασθαι τὸν οἶκον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Is.
					5.43
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				22.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.850d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξαργυρίξεσθαί τινα</span>
			<i>plunder</i> him, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				32.6.1
			</span></i>.</div>
